"""One collected offline acceptance test per founder worksheet row.

Reuse named behavioral fixtures instead of duplicating CLI implementations. Each
selected Node test executes production CLI/tool/Workspace/signature paths and its
own value assertions. Test-name matches must execute, pass, and never be skipped.
The worksheet cells are also checked against the row's declared contract.
"""
